        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur SOLCOV, Coventry Knob with Soleil Rosette</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Black Porcelain Coventry Knob with Soleil Rose is a unique knobset perfect for transitional interiors. This Porcelain Knobset has a transitional feel due to the pairing of a more modern color, black, and a traditional material, porcelain. The Soleil Rose brings boldness to the knobset. The Coventry Knob with Soleil Rosette is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions. The Soleil Rosette is available in a wide array of finish options, all of which look stunning with the Black Porcelain Coventry Knob.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Grandeur SOLCOV Soleil Rosette with Black Porcelain Coventry Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Coventry Knob with Soleil Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Knob Material: Porcelain</li>\r\n<li>Rose Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 2.30\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 2.44\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2.7\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GRA-SOLCOV-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262385\" target=\"new\"><b>Grandeur SOLCOV Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting A Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working knob. Non-locking and non-latching trim for one side of door. This inactive pull is usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> Surfaced mounted, non-working knobs. Non-locking and non-latching trim for both sides of door. These inactive pulls are usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> Latches but does not lock. The latch is activated by turning the either of the two knobs.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> Latches and can be locked. Can be locked from the inside with a push-button.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</li>\r\n</p>",
